WEBVTT

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.480
What color is Freddie Gray?

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:35.800
What color is Mike Brown?

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.856
Finally, I'd found a way

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:43.976
to connect my racialized
understanding of color

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.120
with my theoretical
understanding of color.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:50.056
And I gave birth to my third baby:

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.616
"Color(ed) Theory."

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.400
(Laughter)

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:57.216
"Color(ed) Theory"
was a two-year artistic project

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:02.016
in which I applied my own color palette
to my own neighborhoods